  "author_association": "OWNER",
  "body": "## Summary\n\n- Add a compact Usage Summary strip above the Overview metric cards with period usage, cache share, dominant source/model, peak day, pricing coverage, and next inspection cue.\n- Replace ambiguous Tool Source state copy with `Included in totals` / `Focused` and synchronize source/model focus across chart, legend, and model table.\n- Add peak-day chart annotation plus richer tooltip daily totals and top contributors.\n- Move UI/prose typography toward sans while keeping numeric and model-oriented values in mono.\n\nCloses #23.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `node --check` on extracted inline dashboard script\n- `uv run python -m unittest tests.test_app tests.test_readme -v`\n- `uv run python -m py_compile app.py scripts/snapshot_dashboard.py`\n- `scripts/review.sh`\n- Browser smoke at `http://127.0.0.1:18423/?simulate=1`: verified Usage Summary rendering, source focus, legend model focus, table synchronization, peak marker, mobile wrapping, and no console warnings/errors.",
